I've sometimes carried Sting as a secondary weapon for a simple
reason: being a dagger, it doesn't weigh much.  You're not planning on
fighting with it, so the damage rating is secondary.

Is this the same character you posted about before, and if so, didn't
you mention having Werebane?  That or a non-artifact silver saber
might also be useful, if you expect to encounter silver-haters.

> But I am reluctant to use one of the longsword artifacts; Excalibur
> blasts me and I've only about 100 HPs.

I'd recommend Excalibur otherwise, but that may indeed be a valid
reason not to use it.

Fire Brand isn't a bad choice either, despite your reluctance, and has
one thing going for it as an alternative weapon: if you forget you're
wielding it, the "Monster is on fire!" messages should alert you.

